        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zetris takes the classic falling-block formula and flips it on its head — literally. Instead of squares, you're working with <strong>triangles</strong>. Close them together, trigger line clears, and watch the satisfying geometry snap into place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up. Hard to put down. Devilishly pointy to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎮 9 Modes to keep you hooked:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal</strong> — The classic Zetris experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed</strong> — How fast can you really think?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zen</strong> — Relax. No pressure. Just shapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mixer</strong> — Chaos mode. Expect the unexpected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>…and 5 more waiting to be unlocked</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏆 30+ Steam Achievements</strong> — from casual milestones to brutal challenges for the dedicated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌈 Colorful, chill, and oddly addictive</strong> — perfect for a 5-minute break or a 2-hour session.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Try it free with the demo before you buy!</i></p>",
